tion in the analytics Console Bridge** (port 3334) —\n  GHSA-4jm9-m3fr-9jpx, reported by @manus-pi. Affected 1.11.0 through\n  1.29.6. Terminal input is spawned with argv and passed through the\n  environment instead of interpolated into `expect`/`osascript` source, the\n  macOS `do script` fallback is removed, and the WebSocket handshake now\n  requires a loopback peer, the local dashboard origin and a per-process token.\n- **Same class, found by the follow-up audit**: `--health-check`,\n  `--command-stats`, `--hook-stats`, `--mcp-stats`, global agent wrappers and\n  `--clone-session` no longer pass text from project files, downloaded\n  components or arguments through a shell. The Claude API proxy (port 3335)\n  binds to loopback and refuses browser and non-loopback requests. A setting\n  component can only write files under `.claude/`.\n\n### Changed\n- Mods: removed the early-access warning and the\n  `CLAUDE_CODE_ENABLE_FUNCTION_HOOKS` instruction; Claude Code 2.1.287+ loads\n  mods by default.\n\n","is_prerelease":false},"readme":true,"readme_zh":false,"news":[{"title":"Claude Code Templates","url":"https://github.com/davila7/claude-code-templates","hn":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47114812","source":"Hacker News","lang":"en","date":"2026-02-22","points":2,"comments":0},{"title":"Claude Codeが一気に便利になる。GitHubで人気の「Skill」6選と使い方","url":"https://note.com/horse_racing_jra/n/nfe5bfa1470a9","source":"note","lang":"zh","date":"2026-11-06"},{"title":"Claude Code Templates：终极AI开发助手，5分钟搭建完整开发环境","url":"https://blog.csdn.net/gitblog_01118/article/details/151984799","source":"blog.csdn","lang":"zh","date":"2026-07-13"},{"title":"【GitHub项目推荐--Claude Code Templates：Claude Code 配置与监控 CLI 工具】⭐⭐⭐","url":"https://blog.csdn.net/j8267643/article/details/153735666","source":"blog.csdn","lang":"zh","date":"2025-10-22"},{"title":"AIコーディングが10倍ラクになる！Claude Code Templates完全ガイド","url":"https://note.com/unikoukokun/n/n8e8335773889","source":"note","lang":"zh","date":"2025-10-22"},{